{"metadata":{"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"title":[{"Plain":"解析函子 (算畴理论)"},2],"slug":[{"Plain":"解析函子"},0],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p><strong>解析函子</strong>是解析函数 (形式幂级数) 的"},{"Local":{"url":"范畴化","text":"范畴化"}},{"Plain":", 有多个不同场合的相互关联的概念.</p>\n<p>注意这个概念不同于 "},{"Local":{"url":"Goodwillie演算","text":"Goodwillie 演算"}},{"Plain":"中的"},{"Local":{"url":"解析函子(Goodwillie)","text":"解析函子"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<h2>性质</h2>\n<h3>与多项式函子的关系</h3>\n<p>见"},{"Local":{"url":"多项式函子","text":"多项式函子"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n"}]}}